  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a wok over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chicken breast and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the bhuna paste and stir-fry for 1-2 minutes.",
    "Add the grated ginger, minced garlic, and sliced green chili. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the melted white chocolate and stir-fry for another minute.",
    "Add the bao buns to the wok and cook for 2-3 minutes on each side, until crispy and golden brown.",
    "Serve the chicken and bao buns hot, garnished with chopped scallions."
